graph TD
  D["Definition (application code)<br/>no pending flag, timer or resource"]
  B["Binding: one definition on one<br/>rendered instance"]
  E["User event on the instance"]
  P["Activation prefix: input, atActivation<br/>binding running, no timer"]
  Q["Prerequisites in order (sync or async), then<br/>handler. Work deadline starts after the prefix"]
  L["Local async work<br/>(optional, inside the handler)"]
  S["Server request (optional, through call)<br/>own lifetime, see server figure"]
  SH["Required onSuccess, own hookMs<br/>error or timeout can decide failed"]
  H["Outcome decided once"]
  FH["After the decision: outcome hook, releases of<br/>untransferred scope tokens, onFinally if configured<br/>each under its own hookMs, then settled"]
  C["Presenting callback, still active:<br/>await, then its own current()"]
  F{"current() true?"}
  W["Synchronous presentation write"]
  X["Skip the write<br/>outcome stays as decided"]
  R["Resource held by a token<br/>in the invocation's scope"]
  O["Application resource owner<br/>e.g. player lease"]
  OT["Application policy: owner's own<br/>teardown ends a retained lease"]
  T["Selection change, label loss<br/>or ActionBinding.dispose()"]
  HT["Host teardown: onTeardown"]
  HC["Host closes the connection<br/>after the answer"]
  K["Later idempotent connection.dispose()<br/>separate from host closure"]
  D -->|attached to| B
  E --> B
  B -->|admitted| P
  P --> Q
  Q -.-> L
  Q -.->|call: signal and time left| S
  Q -->|handler returned| SH
  Q -->|throw, deadline or cancel| H
  SH --> H
  H --> FH
  SH -.->|may present| C
  FH -.->|may present| C
  C --> F
  F -->|yes| W
  F -->|no| X
  Q -->|acquires| R
  R -->|explicit handoff by the application| O
  R -.->|not handed off: released in cleanup| FH
  T -->|cancels an undecided invocation| Q
  HT -->|disposes each binding| T
  HT -->|owner's own teardown| OT
  OT --> O
  HT -.->|answers the host, no view-side close| HC
  HC -.-> K
